From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Julien Etienne <julien.etienne@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 10:43:43 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 442/443] wifi: mt6797: create wlan0 by itself

NO_AUTO_VIF left the phy without an interface until a script added one,
so a system with no such script has no wlan0. Let mac80211 create it, as
the daily-use plan's goal says.

Part of the Wi-Fi daily-use plan, phase 2.
---
 drivers/net/wireless/mediatek/mt6797/main.c | 1 -
 1 file changed, 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/net/wireless/mediatek/mt6797/main.c b/drivers/net/wireless/mediatek/mt6797/main.c
index 3191cbcbf..dce04e251 100644
--- a/drivers/net/wireless/mediatek/mt6797/main.c
+++ b/drivers/net/wireless/mediatek/mt6797/main.c
@@ -2130,7 +2130,6 @@ static int mt6797_mac_register(struct device *dev, struct mt6797_hif *hif,
 	ieee80211_hw_set(hw, SIGNAL_DBM);
 	SET_IEEE80211_DEV(hw, dev);
 	SET_IEEE80211_PERM_ADDR(hw, data + 4);
-	ieee80211_hw_set(hw, NO_AUTO_VIF);
 	hw->queues = 4;
 	ieee80211_hw_set(hw, REPORTS_TX_ACK_STATUS);
 	ieee80211_hw_set(hw, SINGLE_SCAN_ON_ALL_BANDS);
-- 
